    "body": "The `end-of-file-fixer` hook now has two `exclude:` keys. In YAML, duplicate keys are ambiguous and most parsers will keep only the last one, which means the newly added `spec/std/isa/csr/.*hpmcounter.*\\.yaml$` exclusion will be ignored. Combine these patterns into a single `exclude:` regex (or move to `files:`/`exclude:` appropriately) so both exclusions apply and the config stays valid for stricter YAML tooling.\n```suggestion\n        exclude: (cfgs/profile.*|.*\\.golden\\.adoc$|.*\\.svg|amo.*\\.yaml|container\\.def|\\.github/workflows/regress\\.yml|spec/std/isa/csr/.*hpmcounter.*\\.yaml$|Z3_VERSION$)\n```",
